      "[The Graveyard Temporalis]"
    ],
    "description": [
      "The land rises as the path moves eastward, and in the distance, the vague outline of buildings stand as silent black sentinels against the ever-changing horizon.  Despite the proximity to town, there are no sounds typical of inhabitance.  No voices, no movement of wagons, no music, or merriment.  There is only the silence of the graveyard, the soft wind that rustles its tree limbs and whistles past monuments and the occasional whisper that brushes by, indistinct and indecipherable, as it passes."
